OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill be cool, but temperatures will
OL,7,Frise through the night to feel mild by
OL,8,Fdawn. Spells of rain will arrive
OL,9,Fduring the early hours.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FMurky with patchy rain and
OL,12,Fsome heavier outbreaks, and mostly
OL,13,Fovercast though with occasional clear
OL,14,Fspells during the afternoon. Feeling
OL,15,Fbreezy and very mild, with
OL,16,Ftemperatures reaching the high-teens.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
