OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FRain
OL,6,Fwill pass on Tuesday morning to become
OL,7,Fbright, fresh and windy. Breezy during
OL,8,FWednesday but dry with sunny spells,
OL,9,Fthen increasingly cloudy, wet and
OL,10,Fwindy through Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
